<title>FINLAND: FINNYARDS SAYS WINS OVER FIM 300 MLN ORDER.</title>
<headline>FINNYARDS SAYS WINS OVER FIM 300 MLN ORDER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish shipyard Finnyards, in which forestry group UPM-Kymmene holds a large stake, said on Thursday it had won an icebreaker order worth over 300 million markka from the Finnish Board of Navigation.</p>
<p>&quot;The ship will be delivered to the Board of Navigation in spring 1998,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Finnyards said its current order backlog including the icebreaker order amounted to 1.3 billion markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
